---
layout: base.njk
title: Shades of Beautiful Photography
---

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="slide"><img src="/images/hero-bride-swing.jpg" alt="A bride in a long white gown on a rope swing under an oak tree in golden morning light" style="object-position:60% 28%" fetchpriority="high"></div>
    <div class="slide"><img src="/images/sky-sunset.jpg" alt="A farmhouse under a pink and orange sunset sky" decoding="async"></div>
    <div class="slide"><img src="/images/hero-bw-couple.jpg" alt="A black and white photo of a couple walking on a beach below the Golden Gate Bridge" decoding="async" style="object-position:66% 50%"></div>
    <div class="slide"><img src="/images/sky-night.jpg" alt="The Milky Way over an old barn at night" decoding="async"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Real life,<span>in every shade of light.</span></h1>
      <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>Photographs and notes, mostly in natural light.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="index" aria-label="Browse the photos">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="#weddings">Weddings</a>
      <a href="#portraits">Portraits</a>
      <a href="#family">Children and family</a>
      <a href="#ceremonies">Church ceremonies</a>
      <a href="#sky">Land and sky</a>
      <a href="#journal">Journal</a>
      <a href="#hello">Say hello</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="sess" id="weddings">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2>Weddings</h2>
        <p>The ceremony, the rings, and the quiet walks in between.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="g-wed">
        <figure class="plate p-beach">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/wedding-beach.jpg" alt="A bride and groom embracing on a beach with the Golden Gate Bridge behind them" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 60%"></div>
          <figcaption>On the beach below the Golden Gate Bridge</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="plate p-rings">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/wedding-rings.jpg" alt="Two cupped hands holding a pair of wedding rings" loading="lazy"></div>
          <figcaption>The rings</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sess alt" id="portraits">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2>Portraits</h2>
        <p>Natural-light portraits with the evening sun doing the work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="g-por">
        <figure class="plate p-hair">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/portrait-golden-hair.jpg" alt="A young woman with golden wavy hair looking over her shoulder, with sunlit trees behind her" loading="lazy" style="object-position:80% 40%"></div>
          <figcaption>Portrait in warm light</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="plate p-barn">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/portrait-barn.jpg" alt="A young man in a blue plaid shirt leaning against a weathered barn wall" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 35%"></div>
          <figcaption>Against an old barn wall</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sess" id="family">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2>Children and family</h2>
        <p>Unscripted laughter, walks outside, and warm hugs at home.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="g-fam">
        <figure class="plate p-child">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/child-frame.jpg" alt="A smiling child in a colorful top holding an empty picture frame in front of a barn wall" loading="lazy"></div>
          <figcaption>A child with an empty frame</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="plate p-truck">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/family-truck.jpg" alt="A group of family and friends gathered on a truck in golden hills" loading="lazy"></div>
          <figcaption>Everyone on the truck</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sess alt" id="ceremonies">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2>Church ceremonies</h2>
        <p>First communions and other celebrations, photographed without getting in the way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="g-dip">
        <figure class="plate">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/communion-veil.jpg" alt="A priest leaning toward a girl in a white veil during a first communion" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 30%"></div>
          <figcaption>First communion</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="plate">
          <div class="pic"><img src="/images/communion-bw.jpg" alt="A girl in a white veil and pearls with other children in white behind her" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 30%"></div>
          <figcaption>The procession</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sky" id="sky">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2>Land and sky</h2>
        <p>When there's no one to photograph, there's still the light.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="strip">
      <div class="pic"><img src="/images/sky-sunset.jpg" alt="A farmhouse under a pink and orange sunset sky" loading="lazy" style="object-position:40% 50%"></div>
      <div class="pic"><img src="/images/sky-lightning.jpg" alt="Lightning over a flooded field under a purple storm sky" loading="lazy" style="object-position:72% 50%"></div>
      <div class="pic"><img src="/images/sky-night.jpg" alt="The Milky Way over an old barn at night" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 50%"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-journal" id="journal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2>Journal</h2>
        <p>Notes from sessions, weddings, and the light in between.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        {% for p in collections.journal | limit(3) %}
          {% include "card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <h2 id="hello">Say hello</h2>
      <p>I'm Darwin. I take pictures because I love it, mostly in natural light. I'm not taking on regular photography work these days, but I still like hearing from people. If there's something you'd love photographed, write to me. I might say yes.</p>
      <div class="direct">
        <a href="mailto:hello@shadesofbeautiful.com">hello@shadesofbeautiful.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

